<title>USA: BostonFed Bancorp sets stock buyback.</title>
<headline>BostonFed Bancorp sets stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Mass. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>BostonFed Bancorp Inc said Friday it would buy back up to 313,015 shares, or five percent of its outstanding common stock.</p>
<p>The shares will be purchased in the open market before October 24, it said.</p>
<p>Separately, the company said that on February 7 it completed the acquisition of Broadway Capital Corp, holding company of Broadway National Bank, for $22 million cash.</p>
<p>It said it expected the transaction to be immediately accretive to earnings.</p>
</text>
